usb: dwc2: record bounded missed-isochronous recovery evidence

Diagnostics only: retain per-path drop counts and first/last/worst burst
start context across endpoint reopens. Expose through read-only debugfs; no IRQ
printk, no change to endpoint cadence or recovery decisions. last_irq is the
last endpoint interrupt flags, which can precede a process-context queue.

